\[
\nu_j(f_{\mathrm{key}})=\Theta_j
\quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad
\omega_j\ne0.
\]

This proves (a), including the identically-zero case through the
convention \(\nu_j(f_{\mathrm{key}})=+\infty\).
```

