Replace T4.2(b)’s proof paragraph with:

```markdown
Let \(g\in\mathscr D_{<\mu_2}\) and let
\(f=f_{\mathrm{key}}+g\) be a member. By the definitions in S0,
\(C_j\) and \(\operatorname{Sh}C_j\) are linear maps on
